1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,589
A wise teacher sits under a large banyan tree in a peaceful
garden.

2
00:00:04,589 --> 00:00:09,240
Students gather around the teacher with notebooks and eager
expressions.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:14,529
The teacher begins explaining the concept of dharma with
gentle hand gestures.

4
00:00:14,529 --> 00:00:18,879
Ancient scriptures lie open on a wooden table beside the
teacher.

5
00:00:18,879 --> 00:00:23,339
Sunlight filters through the leaves creating patterns on
the ground.

6
00:00:23,339 --> 00:00:27,710
The teacher draws symbols in the sand to illustrate key
points.

7
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:31,149
Students nod in understanding as wisdom is shared.

8
00:00:31,149 --> 00:00:35,630
Birds chirp softly in the background adding to the serene
atmosphere.
